html:
{%- macro v(value) -%}{{ (value or "") | e }}{%- endmacro -%}
{%- macro day(value) -%}{{ frappe.utils.format_date(value) if value else "" }}{%- endmacro -%}
{%- macro money(value) -%}{{ "{:,.0f}".format(value | float) if value else "" }}{%- endmacro -%}
{%- macro dots(n) -%}{% for i in range(n) %}&hellip;{% endfor %}{%- endmacro -%}
<style>
.lpl-letter { font-family: Cambria, Georgia, serif; font-size: 12.5px; color: #000; line-height: 1.55; }
.lpl-letter p { margin: 0 0 12px; }
.lpl-letter .addr { font-weight: bold; margin: 0; }
.lpl-letter h4 { font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline; margin: 14px 0 12px; }
.lpl-letter .logo { text-align: right; margin: 0 0 18px; }
.lpl-letter .sign-off { margin: 22px 0 0; }
.lpl-letter .who { font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 0; }
.lpl-letter ol, .lpl-letter ul { margin: 0 0 12px 18px; padding: 0; }
.lpl-letter li { margin: 0 0 4px; }
.lpl-form table.grid { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 0 0 14px; }
.lpl-form table.grid th, .lpl-form table.grid td { border: 1px solid #000; padding: 5px 7px; font-size: 12px;
  text-align: left; vertical-align: top; }
.lpl-form table.grid th { background: #f2f2f2; font-weight: bold; }
.lpl-form .ref { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 0 0 14px; }
.lpl-form .ref td { border: 1px solid #000; padding: 4px 6px; font-size: 11px; }
.lpl-form h3 { font-size: 13px; text-align: center; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 10px 0 14px; }
.lpl-comment { border: 1px solid #000; padding: 8px 10px; margin: 0 0 12px; }
.lpl-comment .head { font-weight: bold; margin: 0 0 6px; }
.lpl-comment .body { min-height: 42px; white-space: pre-wrap; }
</style>
<div class="lpl-form lpl-letter">
{%- set ref = "LPL/HR/26" %}{% set issued = "17/11/2020" %}
{% set title = "Employee Bank Account, NSSF and TIN No. Form" %}
<table class="ref"><tr>
<td rowspan="2" style="width:34%"><b>LUUKA PLASTICS LIMITED</b></td>
<td>Doc Ref. No: {{ ref }}</td><td>Initial Issue Date {{ issued }}</td></tr>
<tr><td>Revision Date: NIL</td><td>Revision No. 0</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="3" style="text-align:center"><b>{{ title }}</b></td></tr></table>

<p><b>PART A: EMPLOYEE ADVICE AND INSTRUCTIONS</b></p>
<p>The department for the time being responsible for finance is hereby advised that I have of my own free will entered
into contractual relations by which I opened a bank account of the following details:</p>
<table class="grid">
<tr><th style="width:32%">Name of Bank</th><td>{{ v(doc.bank_name) }}</td></tr>
<tr><th>Name of Branch</th><td>{{ v(doc.custom_bank_branch) }}</td></tr>
<tr><th>Account Name</th><td>{{ v(doc.custom_bank_account_name or doc.employee_name) }}</td></tr>
<tr><th>Account Number</th><td>{{ v(doc.bank_ac_no) }}</td></tr>
<tr><th>NSSF Number</th><td>{{ v(doc.custom_nssf_no) }}</td></tr>
<tr><th>Tin Number</th><td>{{ v(doc.custom_tin) }}</td></tr>
<tr><th>NIN Number</th><td>{{ v(doc.custom_nin) }}</td></tr>
</table>
<p>The department for the time being responsible for finance is further instructed to continually remit my accrued
monthly salary to the above mentioned bank account with effect from the month of
{{ v(doc.custom_salary_from_month) }}. This instruction shall remain valid for as long as I remain an employee of
Luuka Plastics (U) Ltd or until it is unequivocally revoked under my hand, whichever event may precede the other.</p>
<p><b>PART B: EMPLOYEE DECLARATION</b></p>
<p>I declare that the advice supplied and instructions issued in Part A hereof are conscious and free statements made
by myself and at my own instance.</p>
<table class="grid">
<tr><th style="width:22%">Name</th><td>{{ v(doc.employee_name) }}</td>
<th style="width:14%">I.D. No</th><td>{{ v(doc.employee_number or doc.name) }}</td></tr>
<tr><th>Designation</th><td>{{ v(doc.designation) }}</td><th>Department</th><td>{{ v(doc.department) }}</td></tr>
<tr><th>Signature</th><td>&nbsp;</td><th>Date</th><td>{{ day(doc.custom_bank_declared_on) }}</td></tr>
</table>
<p>Witnessed by Name, Signature &amp; Date:
{{ v(frappe.db.get_value("Employee", doc.custom_bank_witness, "employee_name") if doc.custom_bank_witness else "") }}
&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip; &hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;</p>
</div>
